{"totalPages calculation is off-by-one for exact multiples of limit - Math.floor(user_count / limit) + 1 produces an extra phantom page when user_count is an exact multiple of limit, enabling a 'next' button that loads an empty page of results": 0.8909719586372375, "Test uses wrong HTTP method - test 'cannot remove members from automatic groups' sends xhr :put but the route for remove_member is DELETE, so it routes to add_members instead and doesn't actually test the remove_member action": 0.9695152044296265, "group.users.delete() receives an integer ID instead of a User record - AR CollectionProxy#delete on a has_many :through association expects record objects, not integer IDs, which will either raise a NoMethodError or silently fail to remove the user": 0.8360321521759033}